# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day24

## Question

Tell me about a memorable experience you had at school or university.

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- When it happened
- Where it happened
- What happened
- Who was with you
- How you felt
- Why you remember it

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> One thing I remember clearly is...

Also try to use:

> At the time,...

> What happened next was...

> Looking back,...

---

## Recommended Structure

I remember...

↓

One thing I remember clearly is...

↓

At the time,...

↓

What happened next was...

↓

I felt...

↓

Looking back,...

↓

That's why I still remember it.
